# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / Linux 之间来回改行尾
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确标记二进制，防止 git 尝试做文本转换
*.gif  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
*.exe  binary

# 中文 json / 简谱文本按 UTF-8 处理，diff 更可读
*.json text working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.txt  text working-tree-encoding=UTF-8

# 让 GitHub 正确统计语言
*.py   text
